{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "No new capped safe and legal routes for refugees to come to the UK",
        "additional_details": "As a country we believe we simply cannot support any more refugees /asylum seekers \u2013 we are unable to cope with those who are already arriving and cannot document or vet them correctly.",
        "background": "We want the Government to abandon its plans for \"capped safe and legal\" routes for refugees to come to the UK, including the new sponsorship scheme announced by the Home Secretary on 26 June",
